  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/kotlin-for-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/FORGE  REQUIRES-1e2a41?labelColor=gray&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/kotlin-for-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/KOTLIN FOR FORGE-blue?logo=kotlin&amp;labelColor=gray&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CREATE-ae7c38?logo=curseforge&amp;labelColor=gray&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\"></a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-language-kotlin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/FABRIC REQUIRES-c6bca5?labelColor=gray&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-language-kotlin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/FABRIC LANGUAGE KOTLIN-blue?logo=kotlin&amp;labelColor=gray&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CREATE FABRIC-ae7c38?logo=curseforge&amp;labelColor=gray&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\"></a></p><p>使用黄铜，你可以将你的铜制背罐升级为喷气背包，利用内部的高压空气推动自己在空中飞行。</p><p>灵感来源于<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simply-jetpacks-2\" rel=\"nofollow\">Simply Jetpacks</a>，这款喷气背包也具备悬浮模式。</p><p>与铜制背罐类似，喷气背包也装备在胸甲槽位，可以为诸如伸缩抓取器等物品提供空气，并且可以附魔<em>容量</em>。与背罐一样，它通过放置并为其提供旋转力来充能。</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PssbleTrngle/CreateJetpack/1.18.x/screenshots/usage.png\" alt=\"使用\"></p><p>当你在水下快速游泳时，喷气背包会提升你的游泳速度。此外，悬浮模式可以防止你向下漂浮。</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PssbleTrngle/CreateJetpack/1.18.x/screenshots/underwater.png\" alt=\"水下使用\"></p><p>如果安装了类似于<a href=\"https://github.com/illusivesoulworks/elytraslot\" rel=\"nofollow\">Elytra Slot</a>的模组，允许玩家在装备胸甲的同时装备鞘翅，喷气背包会在玩家按下<code>上</code>键时提供类似烟花的推进效果。</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PssbleTrngle/CreateJetpack/1.18.x/screenshots/elytra.png\" alt=\"鞘翅支持\"></p>",
